  "body": "Secure your place in the highly sought-after Ara Hills community with this thoughtfully designed House & Land Package, offering an affordable pathway into one of Orewa's most desirable coastal locations. Situated on a 280m² freehold section, this proposed 126m² home has been carefully designed to deliver modern comfort, functionality, and low-maintenance living. Whether you're a first-home buyer, growing family, downsizer, or investor, this package offers exceptional value and flexibility. Featuring three bedrooms, two bathrooms, and an internal-access garage, the home design maximises space with a light-filled open-plan kitchen, dining, and living area that forms the heart of the home. Contemporary styling and practical design create a home that is both welcoming and easy to live in. \r\n\r\nFeatures \r\n• 3 Bedrooms | 2 Bathrooms | Internal-Access Garage \r\n• Stylish contemporary exterior design \r\n• Open-plan kitchen, dining & living area \r\n• Light-filled living spaces \r\n• Functional layout designed for modern living \r\n• Low-maintenance section and easy-care lifestyle \r\n• Stamford Insurance included \r\n• Opportunity to personalise selected plans and specifications Lifestyle & Location \r\n\r\nAra Hills offers the perfect balance of coastal living and everyday convenience. Located just minutes from Orewa Beach, local schools, cafés, shopping amenities, parks, and motorway access, this thriving community continues to be one of the Hibiscus Coast's most desirable places to call home. Whether you're commuting to Auckland, enjoying a day at the beach, or spending time with family and friends, you'll love the lifestyle this location provides. \r\n\r\nBuild New, Build Your Way!\r\nThis House & Land Package is based on the proposed home design shown. Alternative plans, upgrades, and personalised selections may be available, allowing you to tailor your future home to suit your lifestyle, preferences, and budget. Enjoy the satisfaction of creating a brand-new home while benefiting from the confidence and peace of mind that comes with building new. \r\n\r\nPrice: From $958,000 Home design, layouts, and upgrade options can be tailored to suit your needs. \r\n\r\nVisit our Showhome at 49 Ara Hill Drive, Orewa to explore the possibilities. \r\nContact our team today for plans, specifications, and further information.",
